[[:db/add "d79d7341-1973-5d7b-ac0b-0797293dbe4d" :answer/id #uuid "d79d7341-1973-5d7b-ac0b-0797293dbe4d"] [:db/add "d79d7341-1973-5d7b-ac0b-0797293dbe4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d79d7341-1973-5d7b-ac0b-0797293dbe4d" :answer/value "- \\frac{7 \\sec{\\left(- 5 x \\right)}}{5}"] [:db/ensure "d79d7341-1973-5d7b-ac0b-0797293dbe4d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "00f7e62b-077a-54d7-8638-cd1efc363493" :answer-field/id #uuid "00f7e62b-077a-54d7-8638-cd1efc363493"] [:db/add "00f7e62b-077a-54d7-8638-cd1efc363493" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "00f7e62b-077a-54d7-8638-cd1efc363493" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "00f7e62b-077a-54d7-8638-cd1efc363493" :answer-field/choices "d79d7341-1973-5d7b-ac0b-0797293dbe4d"] [:db/add "00f7e62b-077a-54d7-8638-cd1efc363493" :answer-field/correct "d79d7341-1973-5d7b-ac0b-0797293dbe4d"] [:db/ensure "00f7e62b-077a-54d7-8638-cd1efc363493" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f9a8cd21-dc7c-5e67-8cfe-457222aa02c9" :question/id #uuid "f9a8cd21-dc7c-5e67-8cfe-457222aa02c9"] [:db/add "f9a8cd21-dc7c-5e67-8cfe-457222aa02c9" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 7 \\tan{\\left(- 5 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(- 5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "f9a8cd21-dc7c-5e67-8cfe-457222aa02c9" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 5 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-5.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 7 \\tan{\\left(- 5 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(- 5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{7}{5}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{5}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{7 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7 \\sec{\\left(- 5 x \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f9a8cd21-dc7c-5e67-8cfe-457222aa02c9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f9a8cd21-dc7c-5e67-8cfe-457222aa02c9" :question/answer-fields "00f7e62b-077a-54d7-8638-cd1efc363493"] [:db/ensure "f9a8cd21-dc7c-5e67-8cfe-457222aa02c9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "f9a8cd21-dc7c-5e67-8cfe-457222aa02c9"] [:db/add "863b5b27-ae04-5906-aacf-0d5ac60e3a04" :answer/id #uuid "863b5b27-ae04-5906-aacf-0d5ac60e3a04"] [:db/add "863b5b27-ae04-5906-aacf-0d5ac60e3a04" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "863b5b27-ae04-5906-aacf-0d5ac60e3a04" :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\csc{\\left(- 2 x \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "863b5b27-ae04-5906-aacf-0d5ac60e3a04" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8f8104c5-b0a2-5cfc-b3e1-6a64e97e59f3" :answer-field/id #uuid "8f8104c5-b0a2-5cfc-b3e1-6a64e97e59f3"] [:db/add "8f8104c5-b0a2-5cfc-b3e1-6a64e97e59f3" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "8f8104c5-b0a2-5cfc-b3e1-6a64e97e59f3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "8f8104c5-b0a2-5cfc-b3e1-6a64e97e59f3" :answer-field/choices "863b5b27-ae04-5906-aacf-0d5ac60e3a04"] [:db/add "8f8104c5-b0a2-5cfc-b3e1-6a64e97e59f3" :answer-field/correct "863b5b27-ae04-5906-aacf-0d5ac60e3a04"] [:db/ensure "8f8104c5-b0a2-5cfc-b3e1-6a64e97e59f3" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e415d708-3e73-5f13-95d7-e0704f439fd7" :question/id #uuid "e415d708-3e73-5f13-95d7-e0704f439fd7"] [:db/add "e415d708-3e73-5f13-95d7-e0704f439fd7" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 5 \\cot{\\left(- 2 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(- 2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "e415d708-3e73-5f13-95d7-e0704f439fd7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 5 \\cot{\\left(- 2 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(- 2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{5}{2}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{5}{2}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{5 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5 \\csc{\\left(- 2 x \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e415d708-3e73-5f13-95d7-e0704f439fd7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e415d708-3e73-5f13-95d7-e0704f439fd7" :question/answer-fields "8f8104c5-b0a2-5cfc-b3e1-6a64e97e59f3"] [:db/ensure "e415d708-3e73-5f13-95d7-e0704f439fd7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "e415d708-3e73-5f13-95d7-e0704f439fd7"] [:db/add "987b7251-5c21-5376-8e01-a0bfd0d15fad" :answer/id #uuid "987b7251-5c21-5376-8e01-a0bfd0d15fad"] [:db/add "987b7251-5c21-5376-8e01-a0bfd0d15fad" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "987b7251-5c21-5376-8e01-a0bfd0d15fad" :answer/value "\\cot{\\left(- 2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "987b7251-5c21-5376-8e01-a0bfd0d15fad" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3081ec4b-ef17-50e3-b5cc-7ce15a85ee9e" :answer-field/id #uuid "3081ec4b-ef17-50e3-b5cc-7ce15a85ee9e"] [:db/add "3081ec4b-ef17-50e3-b5cc-7ce15a85ee9e" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "3081ec4b-ef17-50e3-b5cc-7ce15a85ee9e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "3081ec4b-ef17-50e3-b5cc-7ce15a85ee9e" :answer-field/choices "987b7251-5c21-5376-8e01-a0bfd0d15fad"] [:db/add "3081ec4b-ef17-50e3-b5cc-7ce15a85ee9e" :answer-field/correct "987b7251-5c21-5376-8e01-a0bfd0d15fad"] [:db/ensure "3081ec4b-ef17-50e3-b5cc-7ce15a85ee9e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4ef6f8f6-1922-5bdc-a2f1-cc3e307583e8" :question/id #uuid "4ef6f8f6-1922-5bdc-a2f1-cc3e307583e8"] [:db/add "4ef6f8f6-1922-5bdc-a2f1-cc3e307583e8" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 \\csc^{2}{\\left(- 2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "4ef6f8f6-1922-5bdc-a2f1-cc3e307583e8" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\csc^{2}{\\left(- 2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\cot{\\left(- 2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "4ef6f8f6-1922-5bdc-a2f1-cc3e307583e8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "4ef6f8f6-1922-5bdc-a2f1-cc3e307583e8" :question/answer-fields "3081ec4b-ef17-50e3-b5cc-7ce15a85ee9e"] [:db/ensure "4ef6f8f6-1922-5bdc-a2f1-cc3e307583e8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "4ef6f8f6-1922-5bdc-a2f1-cc3e307583e8"] [:db/add "c145488d-7ae1-56c1-a8eb-8c26014398ce" :answer/id #uuid "c145488d-7ae1-56c1-a8eb-8c26014398ce"] [:db/add "c145488d-7ae1-56c1-a8eb-8c26014398ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c145488d-7ae1-56c1-a8eb-8c26014398ce" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\tan{\\left(- 2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "c145488d-7ae1-56c1-a8eb-8c26014398ce" :answer/validate] [:db/add "43695357-3206-5da3-8964-0cbc3811fe60" :answer-field/id #uuid "43695357-3206-5da3-8964-0cbc3811fe60"] [:db/add "43695357-3206-5da3-8964-0cbc3811fe60" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "43695357-3206-5da3-8964-0cbc3811fe60" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "43695357-3206-5da3-8964-0cbc3811fe60" :answer-field/choices "c145488d-7ae1-56c1-a8eb-8c26014398ce"] [:db/add "43695357-3206-5da3-8964-0cbc3811fe60" :answer-field/correct "c145488d-7ae1-56c1-a8eb-8c26014398ce"] [:db/ensure "43695357-3206-5da3-8964-0cbc3811fe60" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "69e31cbe-7694-52bc-a3ff-a9360a8fffab" :question/id #uuid "69e31cbe-7694-52bc-a3ff-a9360a8fffab"] [:db/add "69e31cbe-7694-52bc-a3ff-a9360a8fffab" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(- 2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "69e31cbe-7694-52bc-a3ff-a9360a8fffab" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(- 2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{\\tan{\\left(- 2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "69e31cbe-7694-52bc-a3ff-a9360a8fffab" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "69e31cbe-7694-52bc-a3ff-a9360a8fffab" :question/answer-fields "43695357-3206-5da3-8964-0cbc3811fe60"] [:db/ensure "69e31cbe-7694-52bc-a3ff-a9360a8fffab" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "69e31cbe-7694-52bc-a3ff-a9360a8fffab"] [:db/add "542c6e90-f80c-52ae-9fc3-bff7b0448653" :answer/id #uuid "542c6e90-f80c-52ae-9fc3-bff7b0448653"] [:db/add "542c6e90-f80c-52ae-9fc3-bff7b0448653" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "542c6e90-f80c-52ae-9fc3-bff7b0448653" :answer/value "\\sec{\\left(2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "542c6e90-f80c-52ae-9fc3-bff7b0448653" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fe29454b-a75b-5c7f-a6bf-aeaa639f5f41" :answer-field/id #uuid "fe29454b-a75b-5c7f-a6bf-aeaa639f5f41"] [:db/add "fe29454b-a75b-5c7f-a6bf-aeaa639f5f41" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "fe29454b-a75b-5c7f-a6bf-aeaa639f5f41" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "fe29454b-a75b-5c7f-a6bf-aeaa639f5f41" :answer-field/choices "542c6e90-f80c-52ae-9fc3-bff7b0448653"] [:db/add "fe29454b-a75b-5c7f-a6bf-aeaa639f5f41" :answer-field/correct "542c6e90-f80c-52ae-9fc3-bff7b0448653"] [:db/ensure "fe29454b-a75b-5c7f-a6bf-aeaa639f5f41" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8ad177de-f56b-548a-80fb-4041da0c0739" :question/id #uuid "8ad177de-f56b-548a-80fb-4041da0c0739"] [:db/add "8ad177de-f56b-548a-80fb-4041da0c0739" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 \\tan{\\left(2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "8ad177de-f56b-548a-80fb-4041da0c0739" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\tan{\\left(2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\sec{\\left(2 x - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "8ad177de-f56b-548a-80fb-4041da0c0739" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "8ad177de-f56b-548a-80fb-4041da0c0739" :question/answer-fields "fe29454b-a75b-5c7f-a6bf-aeaa639f5f41"] [:db/ensure "8ad177de-f56b-548a-80fb-4041da0c0739" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "8ad177de-f56b-548a-80fb-4041da0c0739"] [:db/add "f6e3a9b4-6967-5e80-a68f-df56357b77da" :answer/id #uuid "f6e3a9b4-6967-5e80-a68f-df56357b77da"] [:db/add "f6e3a9b4-6967-5e80-a68f-df56357b77da" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f6e3a9b4-6967-5e80-a68f-df56357b77da" :answer/value "\\frac{7 \\csc{\\left(5 x + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}"] [:db/ensure "f6e3a9b4-6967-5e80-a68f-df56357b77da" :answer/validate] [:db/add "daa22f9a-1118-50d0-810b-11c451d6a55d" :answer-field/id #uuid "daa22f9a-1118-50d0-810b-11c451d6a55d"] [:db/add "daa22f9a-1118-50d0-810b-11c451d6a55d" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "daa22f9a-1118-50d0-810b-11c451d6a55d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "daa22f9a-1118-50d0-810b-11c451d6a55d" :answer-field/choices "f6e3a9b4-6967-5e80-a68f-df56357b77da"] [:db/add "daa22f9a-1118-50d0-810b-11c451d6a55d" :answer-field/correct "f6e3a9b4-6967-5e80-a68f-df56357b77da"] [:db/ensure "daa22f9a-1118-50d0-810b-11c451d6a55d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "39226942-711b-55fb-b672-0b9498c72c21" :question/id #uuid "39226942-711b-55fb-b672-0b9498c72c21"] [:db/add "39226942-711b-55fb-b672-0b9498c72c21" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 7 \\cot{\\left(5 x + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(5 x + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "39226942-711b-55fb-b672-0b9498c72c21" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x + \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 7 \\cot{\\left(5 x + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(5 x + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{7}{5}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{5}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{7 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{7 \\csc{\\left(5 x + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "39226942-711b-55fb-b672-0b9498c72c21" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "39226942-711b-55fb-b672-0b9498c72c21" :question/answer-fields "daa22f9a-1118-50d0-810b-11c451d6a55d"] [:db/ensure "39226942-711b-55fb-b672-0b9498c72c21" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "39226942-711b-55fb-b672-0b9498c72c21"] [:db/add "e6896d6f-761d-578c-81d5-360fcd6adfd0" :answer/id #uuid "e6896d6f-761d-578c-81d5-360fcd6adfd0"] [:db/add "e6896d6f-761d-578c-81d5-360fcd6adfd0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e6896d6f-761d-578c-81d5-360fcd6adfd0" :answer/value "- \\frac{7 \\cot{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}"] [:db/ensure "e6896d6f-761d-578c-81d5-360fcd6adfd0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a07e1c67-4ecb-5837-8958-50a04cdd0b19" :answer-field/id #uuid "a07e1c67-4ecb-5837-8958-50a04cdd0b19"] [:db/add "a07e1c67-4ecb-5837-8958-50a04cdd0b19" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "a07e1c67-4ecb-5837-8958-50a04cdd0b19" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a07e1c67-4ecb-5837-8958-50a04cdd0b19" :answer-field/choices "e6896d6f-761d-578c-81d5-360fcd6adfd0"] [:db/add "a07e1c67-4ecb-5837-8958-50a04cdd0b19" :answer-field/correct "e6896d6f-761d-578c-81d5-360fcd6adfd0"] [:db/ensure "a07e1c67-4ecb-5837-8958-50a04cdd0b19" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2ce29796-c18d-5902-a450-5c6a1b1b5220" :question/id #uuid "2ce29796-c18d-5902-a450-5c6a1b1b5220"] [:db/add "2ce29796-c18d-5902-a450-5c6a1b1b5220" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 7 \\csc^{2}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "2ce29796-c18d-5902-a450-5c6a1b1b5220" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 7 \\csc^{2}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{7}{5}\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{7}{5}\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{7 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7 \\cot{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "2ce29796-c18d-5902-a450-5c6a1b1b5220" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "2ce29796-c18d-5902-a450-5c6a1b1b5220" :question/answer-fields "a07e1c67-4ecb-5837-8958-50a04cdd0b19"] [:db/ensure "2ce29796-c18d-5902-a450-5c6a1b1b5220" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "2ce29796-c18d-5902-a450-5c6a1b1b5220"] [:db/add "209c646d-cdab-5040-9f0e-4b1c81b98409" :answer/id #uuid "209c646d-cdab-5040-9f0e-4b1c81b98409"] [:db/add "209c646d-cdab-5040-9f0e-4b1c81b98409" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "209c646d-cdab-5040-9f0e-4b1c81b98409" :answer/value "- \\frac{3 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "209c646d-cdab-5040-9f0e-4b1c81b98409" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d871cdba-45ff-5925-9b05-a112885553d2" :answer-field/id #uuid "d871cdba-45ff-5925-9b05-a112885553d2"] [:db/add "d871cdba-45ff-5925-9b05-a112885553d2" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "d871cdba-45ff-5925-9b05-a112885553d2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "d871cdba-45ff-5925-9b05-a112885553d2" :answer-field/choices "209c646d-cdab-5040-9f0e-4b1c81b98409"] [:db/add "d871cdba-45ff-5925-9b05-a112885553d2" :answer-field/correct "209c646d-cdab-5040-9f0e-4b1c81b98409"] [:db/ensure "d871cdba-45ff-5925-9b05-a112885553d2" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "073aeb1d-5ede-5b0d-bfc8-d37ff2d691c4" :question/id #uuid "073aeb1d-5ede-5b0d-bfc8-d37ff2d691c4"] [:db/add "073aeb1d-5ede-5b0d-bfc8-d37ff2d691c4" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - 3 \\sec^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$"] [:db/add "073aeb1d-5ede-5b0d-bfc8-d37ff2d691c4" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 3 \\sec^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{3 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "073aeb1d-5ede-5b0d-bfc8-d37ff2d691c4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "073aeb1d-5ede-5b0d-bfc8-d37ff2d691c4" :question/answer-fields "d871cdba-45ff-5925-9b05-a112885553d2"] [:db/ensure "073aeb1d-5ede-5b0d-bfc8-d37ff2d691c4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "073aeb1d-5ede-5b0d-bfc8-d37ff2d691c4"] [:db/add "6f99cafe-bcac-5579-8d6d-6c31fd9aa27d" :answer/id #uuid "6f99cafe-bcac-5579-8d6d-6c31fd9aa27d"] [:db/add "6f99cafe-bcac-5579-8d6d-6c31fd9aa27d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6f99cafe-bcac-5579-8d6d-6c31fd9aa27d" :answer/value "\\frac{4}{5} - \\frac{8 \\sqrt{3}}{15}"] [:db/ensure "6f99cafe-bcac-5579-8d6d-6c31fd9aa27d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "999f1e33-f8f3-597c-94a5-235188d9ae11" :answer-field/id #uuid "999f1e33-f8f3-597c-94a5-235188d9ae11"] [:db/add "999f1e33-f8f3-597c-94a5-235188d9ae11" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "999f1e33-f8f3-597c-94a5-235188d9ae11" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "999f1e33-f8f3-597c-94a5-235188d9ae11" :answer-field/choices "6f99cafe-bcac-5579-8d6d-6c31fd9aa27d"] [:db/add "999f1e33-f8f3-597c-94a5-235188d9ae11" :answer-field/correct "6f99cafe-bcac-5579-8d6d-6c31fd9aa27d"] [:db/ensure "999f1e33-f8f3-597c-94a5-235188d9ae11" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "55663b8c-42f7-596d-83e8-240de0ec9b1d" :question/id #uuid "55663b8c-42f7-596d-83e8-240de0ec9b1d"] [:db/add "55663b8c-42f7-596d-83e8-240de0ec9b1d" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{10}}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{15}} - 4 \\cot{\\left(- 5 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(- 5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "55663b8c-42f7-596d-83e8-240de0ec9b1d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 5 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-5.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{\\pi}{10}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\x=- \\frac{\\pi}{15}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{10}}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{15}} - 4 \\cot{\\left(- 5 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(- 5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{4 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(- \\frac{8 \\sqrt{3}}{15}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{4}{5}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5} - \\frac{8 \\sqrt{3}}{15}.\n$$"] [:db/add "55663b8c-42f7-596d-83e8-240de0ec9b1d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "55663b8c-42f7-596d-83e8-240de0ec9b1d" :question/answer-fields "999f1e33-f8f3-597c-94a5-235188d9ae11"] [:db/ensure "55663b8c-42f7-596d-83e8-240de0ec9b1d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "55663b8c-42f7-596d-83e8-240de0ec9b1d"] [:db/add "a7fe49a9-9a28-5898-bb50-8a90b07d7af0" :answer/id #uuid "a7fe49a9-9a28-5898-bb50-8a90b07d7af0"] [:db/add "a7fe49a9-9a28-5898-bb50-8a90b07d7af0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a7fe49a9-9a28-5898-bb50-8a90b07d7af0" :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}"] [:db/ensure "a7fe49a9-9a28-5898-bb50-8a90b07d7af0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0a64a6fc-1858-5771-a346-4f80a390ad46" :answer-field/id #uuid "0a64a6fc-1858-5771-a346-4f80a390ad46"] [:db/add "0a64a6fc-1858-5771-a346-4f80a390ad46" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "0a64a6fc-1858-5771-a346-4f80a390ad46" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "0a64a6fc-1858-5771-a346-4f80a390ad46" :answer-field/choices "a7fe49a9-9a28-5898-bb50-8a90b07d7af0"] [:db/add "0a64a6fc-1858-5771-a346-4f80a390ad46" :answer-field/correct "a7fe49a9-9a28-5898-bb50-8a90b07d7af0"] [:db/ensure "0a64a6fc-1858-5771-a346-4f80a390ad46" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a973650d-44b5-5568-9c49-20e47dc4a2f2" :question/id #uuid "a973650d-44b5-5568-9c49-20e47dc4a2f2"] [:db/add "a973650d-44b5-5568-9c49-20e47dc4a2f2" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{12}} 4 \\csc^{2}{\\left(- 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "a973650d-44b5-5568-9c49-20e47dc4a2f2" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\x=- \\frac{\\pi}{12}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{12}} 4 \\csc^{2}{\\left(- 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{4 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "a973650d-44b5-5568-9c49-20e47dc4a2f2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a973650d-44b5-5568-9c49-20e47dc4a2f2" :question/answer-fields "0a64a6fc-1858-5771-a346-4f80a390ad46"] [:db/ensure "a973650d-44b5-5568-9c49-20e47dc4a2f2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "a973650d-44b5-5568-9c49-20e47dc4a2f2"] [:db/add "eaa78a60-e433-5623-ba90-70c9b3b3bd88" :answer/id #uuid "eaa78a60-e433-5623-ba90-70c9b3b3bd88"] [:db/add "eaa78a60-e433-5623-ba90-70c9b3b3bd88" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "eaa78a60-e433-5623-ba90-70c9b3b3bd88" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}"] [:db/ensure "eaa78a60-e433-5623-ba90-70c9b3b3bd88" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1d41f863-ce27-51af-8ff8-4ebb35a01076" :answer-field/id #uuid "1d41f863-ce27-51af-8ff8-4ebb35a01076"] [:db/add "1d41f863-ce27-51af-8ff8-4ebb35a01076" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "1d41f863-ce27-51af-8ff8-4ebb35a01076" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1d41f863-ce27-51af-8ff8-4ebb35a01076" :answer-field/choices "eaa78a60-e433-5623-ba90-70c9b3b3bd88"] [:db/add "1d41f863-ce27-51af-8ff8-4ebb35a01076" :answer-field/correct "eaa78a60-e433-5623-ba90-70c9b3b3bd88"] [:db/ensure "1d41f863-ce27-51af-8ff8-4ebb35a01076" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "76a1a2e0-2149-5343-b9b7-1442d550a8de" :question/id #uuid "76a1a2e0-2149-5343-b9b7-1442d550a8de"] [:db/add "76a1a2e0-2149-5343-b9b7-1442d550a8de" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{20}}^{0} 2 \\sec^{2}{\\left(- 5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "76a1a2e0-2149-5343-b9b7-1442d550a8de" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 5 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-5.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{\\pi}{20}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{20}}^{0} 2 \\sec^{2}{\\left(- 5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{0} \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{2 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{0}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{2}{5}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{5}.\n$$"] [:db/add "76a1a2e0-2149-5343-b9b7-1442d550a8de" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "76a1a2e0-2149-5343-b9b7-1442d550a8de" :question/answer-fields "1d41f863-ce27-51af-8ff8-4ebb35a01076"] [:db/ensure "76a1a2e0-2149-5343-b9b7-1442d550a8de" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "76a1a2e0-2149-5343-b9b7-1442d550a8de"] [:db/add "fef5887b-26b3-5aa8-9e51-1e7c0d919e2d" :answer/id #uuid "fef5887b-26b3-5aa8-9e51-1e7c0d919e2d"] [:db/add "fef5887b-26b3-5aa8-9e51-1e7c0d919e2d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fef5887b-26b3-5aa8-9e51-1e7c0d919e2d" :answer/value "-2 + 2 \\sqrt{2}"] [:db/ensure "fef5887b-26b3-5aa8-9e51-1e7c0d919e2d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e8eaa502-7fe5-5d6a-a807-4483e127b7ef" :answer-field/id #uuid "e8eaa502-7fe5-5d6a-a807-4483e127b7ef"] [:db/add "e8eaa502-7fe5-5d6a-a807-4483e127b7ef" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "e8eaa502-7fe5-5d6a-a807-4483e127b7ef" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e8eaa502-7fe5-5d6a-a807-4483e127b7ef" :answer-field/choices "fef5887b-26b3-5aa8-9e51-1e7c0d919e2d"] [:db/add "e8eaa502-7fe5-5d6a-a807-4483e127b7ef" :answer-field/correct "fef5887b-26b3-5aa8-9e51-1e7c0d919e2d"] [:db/ensure "e8eaa502-7fe5-5d6a-a807-4483e127b7ef" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1dd0d444-b9a6-56a7-81ab-1f737d2a3c8a" :question/id #uuid "1dd0d444-b9a6-56a7-81ab-1f737d2a3c8a"] [:db/add "1dd0d444-b9a6-56a7-81ab-1f737d2a3c8a" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{12}}^{0} 6 \\tan{\\left(- 3 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(- 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "1dd0d444-b9a6-56a7-81ab-1f737d2a3c8a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{\\pi}{12}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{12}}^{0} 6 \\tan{\\left(- 3 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(- 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-2\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{0} \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- 2 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{0}=\\left(-2\\right)-\\left(- 2 \\sqrt{2}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n-2 + 2 \\sqrt{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "1dd0d444-b9a6-56a7-81ab-1f737d2a3c8a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "1dd0d444-b9a6-56a7-81ab-1f737d2a3c8a" :question/answer-fields "e8eaa502-7fe5-5d6a-a807-4483e127b7ef"] [:db/ensure "1dd0d444-b9a6-56a7-81ab-1f737d2a3c8a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "1dd0d444-b9a6-56a7-81ab-1f737d2a3c8a"] [:db/add "8ee967d5-fefd-5922-921c-94cee5140c7c" :answer/id #uuid "8ee967d5-fefd-5922-921c-94cee5140c7c"] [:db/add "8ee967d5-fefd-5922-921c-94cee5140c7c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8ee967d5-fefd-5922-921c-94cee5140c7c" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{5} + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{15}"] [:db/ensure "8ee967d5-fefd-5922-921c-94cee5140c7c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "23e14db0-4119-5331-8607-daa0c44fb68d" :answer-field/id #uuid "23e14db0-4119-5331-8607-daa0c44fb68d"] [:db/add "23e14db0-4119-5331-8607-daa0c44fb68d" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "23e14db0-4119-5331-8607-daa0c44fb68d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "23e14db0-4119-5331-8607-daa0c44fb68d" :answer-field/choices "8ee967d5-fefd-5922-921c-94cee5140c7c"] [:db/add "23e14db0-4119-5331-8607-daa0c44fb68d" :answer-field/correct "8ee967d5-fefd-5922-921c-94cee5140c7c"] [:db/ensure "23e14db0-4119-5331-8607-daa0c44fb68d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c583b2c4-8e86-5ae3-86a7-7860d0969586" :question/id #uuid "c583b2c4-8e86-5ae3-86a7-7860d0969586"] [:db/add "c583b2c4-8e86-5ae3-86a7-7860d0969586" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{15}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{10}} \\cot{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "c583b2c4-8e86-5ae3-86a7-7860d0969586" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{15}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{10}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{15}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{10}} \\cot{\\left(5 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{5}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{\\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\left(- \\frac{1}{5}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{15}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{5} + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{15}.\n$$"] [:db/add "c583b2c4-8e86-5ae3-86a7-7860d0969586" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c583b2c4-8e86-5ae3-86a7-7860d0969586" :question/answer-fields "23e14db0-4119-5331-8607-daa0c44fb68d"] [:db/ensure "c583b2c4-8e86-5ae3-86a7-7860d0969586" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "c583b2c4-8e86-5ae3-86a7-7860d0969586"] [:db/add "3b0aa95c-2405-5271-89be-bd02c6d33269" :answer/id #uuid "3b0aa95c-2405-5271-89be-bd02c6d33269"] [:db/add "3b0aa95c-2405-5271-89be-bd02c6d33269" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3b0aa95c-2405-5271-89be-bd02c6d33269" :answer/value "- \\frac{7}{6} + \\frac{7 \\sqrt{3}}{18}"] [:db/ensure "3b0aa95c-2405-5271-89be-bd02c6d33269" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9f481514-f665-5049-865b-c270ae2e8eaa" :answer-field/id #uuid "9f481514-f665-5049-865b-c270ae2e8eaa"] [:db/add "9f481514-f665-5049-865b-c270ae2e8eaa" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "9f481514-f665-5049-865b-c270ae2e8eaa" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9f481514-f665-5049-865b-c270ae2e8eaa" :answer-field/choices "3b0aa95c-2405-5271-89be-bd02c6d33269"] [:db/add "9f481514-f665-5049-865b-c270ae2e8eaa" :answer-field/correct "3b0aa95c-2405-5271-89be-bd02c6d33269"] [:db/ensure "9f481514-f665-5049-865b-c270ae2e8eaa" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c5b1ad32-bb4e-5508-bddb-594979f05fa7" :question/id #uuid "c5b1ad32-bb4e-5508-bddb-594979f05fa7"] [:db/add "c5b1ad32-bb4e-5508-bddb-594979f05fa7" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{24}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{18}} - 7 \\csc^{2}{\\left(6 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "c5b1ad32-bb4e-5508-bddb-594979f05fa7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=6 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{24}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{18}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{24}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{18}} - 7 \\csc^{2}{\\left(6 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{7}{6}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{7 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{6}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(\\frac{7 \\sqrt{3}}{18}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{7}{6}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{7}{6} + \\frac{7 \\sqrt{3}}{18}.\n$$"] [:db/add "c5b1ad32-bb4e-5508-bddb-594979f05fa7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c5b1ad32-bb4e-5508-bddb-594979f05fa7" :question/answer-fields "9f481514-f665-5049-865b-c270ae2e8eaa"] [:db/ensure "c5b1ad32-bb4e-5508-bddb-594979f05fa7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "c5b1ad32-bb4e-5508-bddb-594979f05fa7"] [:db/add "70f50210-11fa-5e51-88d9-cb55ccf10758" :answer/id #uuid "70f50210-11fa-5e51-88d9-cb55ccf10758"] [:db/add "70f50210-11fa-5e51-88d9-cb55ccf10758" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "70f50210-11fa-5e51-88d9-cb55ccf10758" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5} - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{5}"] [:db/ensure "70f50210-11fa-5e51-88d9-cb55ccf10758" :answer/validate] [:db/add "11d9b26f-5f57-522a-82c2-d02d262c2a75" :answer-field/id #uuid "11d9b26f-5f57-522a-82c2-d02d262c2a75"] [:db/add "11d9b26f-5f57-522a-82c2-d02d262c2a75" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "11d9b26f-5f57-522a-82c2-d02d262c2a75" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "11d9b26f-5f57-522a-82c2-d02d262c2a75" :answer-field/choices "70f50210-11fa-5e51-88d9-cb55ccf10758"] [:db/add "11d9b26f-5f57-522a-82c2-d02d262c2a75" :answer-field/correct "70f50210-11fa-5e51-88d9-cb55ccf10758"] [:db/ensure "11d9b26f-5f57-522a-82c2-d02d262c2a75" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "939ab3eb-b6a3-53df-aeda-7838bff2e47a" :question/id #uuid "939ab3eb-b6a3-53df-aeda-7838bff2e47a"] [:db/add "939ab3eb-b6a3-53df-aeda-7838bff2e47a" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{20}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{15}} - 2 \\sec^{2}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "939ab3eb-b6a3-53df-aeda-7838bff2e47a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{20}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{15}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{20}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{15}} - 2 \\sec^{2}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{2 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(- \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{5}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{2}{5}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{5} - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{5}.\n$$"] [:db/add "939ab3eb-b6a3-53df-aeda-7838bff2e47a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "939ab3eb-b6a3-53df-aeda-7838bff2e47a" :question/answer-fields "11d9b26f-5f57-522a-82c2-d02d262c2a75"] [:db/ensure "939ab3eb-b6a3-53df-aeda-7838bff2e47a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "939ab3eb-b6a3-53df-aeda-7838bff2e47a"] [:db/add "da28418d-ce9f-5f59-b794-596465adadd4" :answer/id #uuid "da28418d-ce9f-5f59-b794-596465adadd4"] [:db/add "da28418d-ce9f-5f59-b794-596465adadd4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "da28418d-ce9f-5f59-b794-596465adadd4" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3} - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "da28418d-ce9f-5f59-b794-596465adadd4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e97f93d6-8717-5343-9503-137259aa5d19" :answer-field/id #uuid "e97f93d6-8717-5343-9503-137259aa5d19"] [:db/add "e97f93d6-8717-5343-9503-137259aa5d19" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "e97f93d6-8717-5343-9503-137259aa5d19" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e97f93d6-8717-5343-9503-137259aa5d19" :answer-field/choices "da28418d-ce9f-5f59-b794-596465adadd4"] [:db/add "e97f93d6-8717-5343-9503-137259aa5d19" :answer-field/correct "da28418d-ce9f-5f59-b794-596465adadd4"] [:db/ensure "e97f93d6-8717-5343-9503-137259aa5d19" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "03595741-d485-53cb-871d-b8d426aec985" :question/id #uuid "03595741-d485-53cb-871d-b8d426aec985"] [:db/add "03595741-d485-53cb-871d-b8d426aec985" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{24}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{18}} 2 \\tan{\\left(6 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(6 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "03595741-d485-53cb-871d-b8d426aec985" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=6 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{24}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{18}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{24}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{18}} 2 \\tan{\\left(6 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(6 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3} - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "03595741-d485-53cb-871d-b8d426aec985" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "03595741-d485-53cb-871d-b8d426aec985" :question/answer-fields "e97f93d6-8717-5343-9503-137259aa5d19"] [:db/ensure "03595741-d485-53cb-871d-b8d426aec985" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "03595741-d485-53cb-871d-b8d426aec985"] [:db/add "f7a5d38e-3a33-59bc-991f-be6ec110bb4e" :answer/id #uuid "f7a5d38e-3a33-59bc-991f-be6ec110bb4e"] [:db/add "f7a5d38e-3a33-59bc-991f-be6ec110bb4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f7a5d38e-3a33-59bc-991f-be6ec110bb4e" :answer/value "- \\frac{15}{4} + \\frac{5 \\sqrt{3}}{4}"] [:db/ensure "f7a5d38e-3a33-59bc-991f-be6ec110bb4e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ef41ae03-0363-5ab5-8c19-b5a72d57172d" :answer-field/id #uuid "ef41ae03-0363-5ab5-8c19-b5a72d57172d"] [:db/add "ef41ae03-0363-5ab5-8c19-b5a72d57172d" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "ef41ae03-0363-5ab5-8c19-b5a72d57172d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ef41ae03-0363-5ab5-8c19-b5a72d57172d" :answer-field/choices "f7a5d38e-3a33-59bc-991f-be6ec110bb4e"] [:db/add "ef41ae03-0363-5ab5-8c19-b5a72d57172d" :answer-field/correct "f7a5d38e-3a33-59bc-991f-be6ec110bb4e"] [:db/ensure "ef41ae03-0363-5ab5-8c19-b5a72d57172d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ebd5575e-4739-5634-aaed-010e3b1faf38" :question/id #uuid "ebd5575e-4739-5634-aaed-010e3b1faf38"] [:db/add "ebd5575e-4739-5634-aaed-010e3b1faf38" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} - \\frac{5 \\sec^{2}{\\left(- \\frac{2 x}{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "ebd5575e-4739-5634-aaed-010e3b1faf38" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- \\frac{2 x}{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{2}{3}.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} - \\frac{5 \\sec^{2}{\\left(- \\frac{2 x}{3} + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{15}{4}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{15 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{4}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}=\\left(\\frac{5 \\sqrt{3}}{4}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{15}{4}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{15}{4} + \\frac{5 \\sqrt{3}}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "ebd5575e-4739-5634-aaed-010e3b1faf38" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "ebd5575e-4739-5634-aaed-010e3b1faf38" :question/answer-fields "ef41ae03-0363-5ab5-8c19-b5a72d57172d"] [:db/ensure "ebd5575e-4739-5634-aaed-010e3b1faf38" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "ebd5575e-4739-5634-aaed-010e3b1faf38"] [:db/add "3ec8055a-0770-5844-aceb-1096e8a3b4e9" :answer/id #uuid "3ec8055a-0770-5844-aceb-1096e8a3b4e9"] [:db/add "3ec8055a-0770-5844-aceb-1096e8a3b4e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3ec8055a-0770-5844-aceb-1096e8a3b4e9" :answer/value "15 - \\frac{15 \\sqrt{2}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "3ec8055a-0770-5844-aceb-1096e8a3b4e9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f28432f9-fdb3-57cf-97ac-acfd970c0f72" :answer-field/id #uuid "f28432f9-fdb3-57cf-97ac-acfd970c0f72"] [:db/add "f28432f9-fdb3-57cf-97ac-acfd970c0f72" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "f28432f9-fdb3-57cf-97ac-acfd970c0f72" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f28432f9-fdb3-57cf-97ac-acfd970c0f72" :answer-field/choices "3ec8055a-0770-5844-aceb-1096e8a3b4e9"] [:db/add "f28432f9-fdb3-57cf-97ac-acfd970c0f72" :answer-field/correct "3ec8055a-0770-5844-aceb-1096e8a3b4e9"] [:db/ensure "f28432f9-fdb3-57cf-97ac-acfd970c0f72" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "619d9def-2035-560b-b2fc-426e1f28c7bd" :question/id #uuid "619d9def-2035-560b-b2fc-426e1f28c7bd"] [:db/add "619d9def-2035-560b-b2fc-426e1f28c7bd" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{7 \\pi}{4}}^{- \\frac{3 \\pi}{2}} \\frac{5 \\tan{\\left(- \\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(- \\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "619d9def-2035-560b-b2fc-426e1f28c7bd" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- \\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{3}.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{7 \\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\\\x=- \\frac{3 \\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{7 \\pi}{4}}^{- \\frac{3 \\pi}{2}} \\frac{5 \\tan{\\left(- \\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(- \\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{15}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{15 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\left(- \\frac{15 \\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)-\\left(-15\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n15 - \\frac{15 \\sqrt{2}}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "619d9def-2035-560b-b2fc-426e1f28c7bd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "619d9def-2035-560b-b2fc-426e1f28c7bd" :question/answer-fields "f28432f9-fdb3-57cf-97ac-acfd970c0f72"] [:db/ensure "619d9def-2035-560b-b2fc-426e1f28c7bd" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "619d9def-2035-560b-b2fc-426e1f28c7bd"] [:db/add "faceb4f1-8802-5949-89b6-ff9589308076" :answer/id #uuid "faceb4f1-8802-5949-89b6-ff9589308076"] [:db/add "faceb4f1-8802-5949-89b6-ff9589308076" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "faceb4f1-8802-5949-89b6-ff9589308076" :answer/value "\\frac{20}{9} - \\frac{10 \\sqrt{2}}{9}"] [:db/ensure "faceb4f1-8802-5949-89b6-ff9589308076" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c58627f9-6c8a-5834-9ee8-34cfc235dbac" :answer-field/id #uuid "c58627f9-6c8a-5834-9ee8-34cfc235dbac"] [:db/add "c58627f9-6c8a-5834-9ee8-34cfc235dbac" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "c58627f9-6c8a-5834-9ee8-34cfc235dbac" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c58627f9-6c8a-5834-9ee8-34cfc235dbac" :answer-field/choices "faceb4f1-8802-5949-89b6-ff9589308076"] [:db/add "c58627f9-6c8a-5834-9ee8-34cfc235dbac" :answer-field/correct "faceb4f1-8802-5949-89b6-ff9589308076"] [:db/ensure "c58627f9-6c8a-5834-9ee8-34cfc235dbac" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "7176dd16-0df4-55a7-aeeb-1801ac33a090" :question/id #uuid "7176dd16-0df4-55a7-aeeb-1801ac33a090"] [:db/add "7176dd16-0df4-55a7-aeeb-1801ac33a090" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{18}} \\frac{5 \\cot{\\left(- \\frac{3 x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(- \\frac{3 x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "7176dd16-0df4-55a7-aeeb-1801ac33a090" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- \\frac{3 x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{3}{2}.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{18}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{18}} \\frac{5 \\cot{\\left(- \\frac{3 x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(- \\frac{3 x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{10}{9}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{10 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{9}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}=\\left(\\frac{20}{9}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{10 \\sqrt{2}}{9}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{20}{9} - \\frac{10 \\sqrt{2}}{9}.\n$$"] [:db/add "7176dd16-0df4-55a7-aeeb-1801ac33a090" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "7176dd16-0df4-55a7-aeeb-1801ac33a090" :question/answer-fields "c58627f9-6c8a-5834-9ee8-34cfc235dbac"] [:db/ensure "7176dd16-0df4-55a7-aeeb-1801ac33a090" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "7176dd16-0df4-55a7-aeeb-1801ac33a090"] [:db/add "3a633cb9-c226-54ca-aa17-c258b57d502e" :answer/id #uuid "3a633cb9-c226-54ca-aa17-c258b57d502e"] [:db/add "3a633cb9-c226-54ca-aa17-c258b57d502e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3a633cb9-c226-54ca-aa17-c258b57d502e" :answer/value "\\frac{8 \\sqrt{3}}{9}"] [:db/ensure "3a633cb9-c226-54ca-aa17-c258b57d502e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4411b9bd-2f0d-5663-9506-5db3b279da70" :answer-field/id #uuid "4411b9bd-2f0d-5663-9506-5db3b279da70"] [:db/add "4411b9bd-2f0d-5663-9506-5db3b279da70" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "4411b9bd-2f0d-5663-9506-5db3b279da70" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "4411b9bd-2f0d-5663-9506-5db3b279da70" :answer-field/choices "3a633cb9-c226-54ca-aa17-c258b57d502e"] [:db/add "4411b9bd-2f0d-5663-9506-5db3b279da70" :answer-field/correct "3a633cb9-c226-54ca-aa17-c258b57d502e"] [:db/ensure "4411b9bd-2f0d-5663-9506-5db3b279da70" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5915e3a9-56f6-54b6-939f-1f29ec463eca" :question/id #uuid "5915e3a9-56f6-54b6-939f-1f29ec463eca"] [:db/add "5915e3a9-56f6-54b6-939f-1f29ec463eca" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{0} \\frac{2 \\csc^{2}{\\left(- \\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "5915e3a9-56f6-54b6-939f-1f29ec463eca" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- \\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nThe negative derivative is included in the factor outside the new integral.\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{\\pi}{3}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed bounds decrease; keep their order when subtracting endpoint values.\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{0} \\frac{2 \\csc^{2}{\\left(- \\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{4 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}=\\left(\\frac{4 \\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{4 \\sqrt{3}}{9}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{8 \\sqrt{3}}{9}.\n$$"] [:db/add "5915e3a9-56f6-54b6-939f-1f29ec463eca" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "5915e3a9-56f6-54b6-939f-1f29ec463eca" :question/answer-fields "4411b9bd-2f0d-5663-9506-5db3b279da70"] [:db/ensure "5915e3a9-56f6-54b6-939f-1f29ec463eca" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "5915e3a9-56f6-54b6-939f-1f29ec463eca"] [:db/add "b991a52b-4050-5c87-98f1-935ba7acf9ea" :answer/id #uuid "b991a52b-4050-5c87-98f1-935ba7acf9ea"] [:db/add "b991a52b-4050-5c87-98f1-935ba7acf9ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b991a52b-4050-5c87-98f1-935ba7acf9ea" :answer/value "\\frac{9}{2} - \\frac{9 \\sqrt{3}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "b991a52b-4050-5c87-98f1-935ba7acf9ea" :answer/validate] [:db/add "90a82afe-9b5c-5581-ac29-11654aefd369" :answer-field/id #uuid "90a82afe-9b5c-5581-ac29-11654aefd369"] [:db/add "90a82afe-9b5c-5581-ac29-11654aefd369" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "90a82afe-9b5c-5581-ac29-11654aefd369" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "90a82afe-9b5c-5581-ac29-11654aefd369" :answer-field/choices "b991a52b-4050-5c87-98f1-935ba7acf9ea"] [:db/add "90a82afe-9b5c-5581-ac29-11654aefd369" :answer-field/correct "b991a52b-4050-5c87-98f1-935ba7acf9ea"] [:db/ensure "90a82afe-9b5c-5581-ac29-11654aefd369" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ae5adf82-5498-5c01-a1b8-4a2da93e2ba3" :question/id #uuid "ae5adf82-5498-5c01-a1b8-4a2da93e2ba3"] [:db/add "ae5adf82-5498-5c01-a1b8-4a2da93e2ba3" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}} - \\frac{3 \\sec^{2}{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "ae5adf82-5498-5c01-a1b8-4a2da93e2ba3" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}} - \\frac{3 \\sec^{2}{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{9}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{9 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(- \\frac{9 \\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{9}{2}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{9}{2} - \\frac{9 \\sqrt{3}}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "ae5adf82-5498-5c01-a1b8-4a2da93e2ba3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "ae5adf82-5498-5c01-a1b8-4a2da93e2ba3" :question/answer-fields "90a82afe-9b5c-5581-ac29-11654aefd369"] [:db/ensure "ae5adf82-5498-5c01-a1b8-4a2da93e2ba3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "ae5adf82-5498-5c01-a1b8-4a2da93e2ba3"] [:db/add "befba929-9fda-5f48-afb7-dc9545acb297" :answer/id #uuid "befba929-9fda-5f48-afb7-dc9545acb297"] [:db/add "befba929-9fda-5f48-afb7-dc9545acb297" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "befba929-9fda-5f48-afb7-dc9545acb297" :answer/value "- 5 \\sqrt{2} + \\frac{10 \\sqrt{3}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "befba929-9fda-5f48-afb7-dc9545acb297" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7831f77e-feb9-5909-9370-a77527b7e4ab" :answer-field/id #uuid "7831f77e-feb9-5909-9370-a77527b7e4ab"] [:db/add "7831f77e-feb9-5909-9370-a77527b7e4ab" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "7831f77e-feb9-5909-9370-a77527b7e4ab" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "7831f77e-feb9-5909-9370-a77527b7e4ab" :answer-field/choices "befba929-9fda-5f48-afb7-dc9545acb297"] [:db/add "7831f77e-feb9-5909-9370-a77527b7e4ab" :answer-field/correct "befba929-9fda-5f48-afb7-dc9545acb297"] [:db/ensure "7831f77e-feb9-5909-9370-a77527b7e4ab" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1c351c96-eb00-5911-ae50-4a666f600e22" :question/id #uuid "1c351c96-eb00-5911-ae50-4a666f600e22"] [:db/add "1c351c96-eb00-5911-ae50-4a666f600e22" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{0} - \\frac{5 \\tan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "1c351c96-eb00-5911-ae50-4a666f600e22" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{0} - \\frac{5 \\tan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-5\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[- 5 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\left(- 5 \\sqrt{2}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{10 \\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n- 5 \\sqrt{2} + \\frac{10 \\sqrt{3}}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "1c351c96-eb00-5911-ae50-4a666f600e22" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1c351c96-eb00-5911-ae50-4a666f600e22" :question/answer-fields "7831f77e-feb9-5909-9370-a77527b7e4ab"] [:db/ensure "1c351c96-eb00-5911-ae50-4a666f600e22" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "1c351c96-eb00-5911-ae50-4a666f600e22"] [:db/add "e97b264a-92e7-5a52-b1a2-2a700eb0283c" :answer/id #uuid "e97b264a-92e7-5a52-b1a2-2a700eb0283c"] [:db/add "e97b264a-92e7-5a52-b1a2-2a700eb0283c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e97b264a-92e7-5a52-b1a2-2a700eb0283c" :answer/value "- \\frac{9 \\sqrt{2}}{2} + 3 \\sqrt{3}"] [:db/ensure "e97b264a-92e7-5a52-b1a2-2a700eb0283c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6a5e5342-0591-5102-b507-47697fd55990" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a5e5342-0591-5102-b507-47697fd55990"] [:db/add "6a5e5342-0591-5102-b507-47697fd55990" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "6a5e5342-0591-5102-b507-47697fd55990" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "6a5e5342-0591-5102-b507-47697fd55990" :answer-field/choices "e97b264a-92e7-5a52-b1a2-2a700eb0283c"] [:db/add "6a5e5342-0591-5102-b507-47697fd55990" :answer-field/correct "e97b264a-92e7-5a52-b1a2-2a700eb0283c"] [:db/ensure "6a5e5342-0591-5102-b507-47697fd55990" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "36cd3b27-f6e8-592d-99e4-5ee5368b313f" :question/id #uuid "36cd3b27-f6e8-592d-99e4-5ee5368b313f"] [:db/add "36cd3b27-f6e8-592d-99e4-5ee5368b313f" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}} - \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "36cd3b27-f6e8-592d-99e4-5ee5368b313f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}} - \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{9}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{9 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(3 \\sqrt{3}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{9 \\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{9 \\sqrt{2}}{2} + 3 \\sqrt{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "36cd3b27-f6e8-592d-99e4-5ee5368b313f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "36cd3b27-f6e8-592d-99e4-5ee5368b313f" :question/answer-fields "6a5e5342-0591-5102-b507-47697fd55990"] [:db/ensure "36cd3b27-f6e8-592d-99e4-5ee5368b313f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "36cd3b27-f6e8-592d-99e4-5ee5368b313f"] [:db/add "a89b39e9-4843-5bc6-87aa-fddaf1966f77" :answer/id #uuid "a89b39e9-4843-5bc6-87aa-fddaf1966f77"] [:db/add "a89b39e9-4843-5bc6-87aa-fddaf1966f77" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a89b39e9-4843-5bc6-87aa-fddaf1966f77" :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3} - \\frac{4 \\sqrt{3}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "a89b39e9-4843-5bc6-87aa-fddaf1966f77" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8e566b4b-c7af-511a-99be-fd1ad29079da" :answer-field/id #uuid "8e566b4b-c7af-511a-99be-fd1ad29079da"] [:db/add "8e566b4b-c7af-511a-99be-fd1ad29079da" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "8e566b4b-c7af-511a-99be-fd1ad29079da" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "8e566b4b-c7af-511a-99be-fd1ad29079da" :answer-field/choices "a89b39e9-4843-5bc6-87aa-fddaf1966f77"] [:db/add "8e566b4b-c7af-511a-99be-fd1ad29079da" :an